4
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:25,710
And after their most trusted player, Misaki-kun, received treatment for his foot...

5
00:00:25,710 --> 00:00:28,460
...he returned to the field!

6
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:29,840
Misaki-kun.

7
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:32,630
I know what you're thinking.

8
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:35,510
I will get the ball and pass it to you.

9
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:40,550
Tsubasa's counter-attack begins now!

10
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:41,880
Misaki!

11
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:43,450
We're counting on you, Misaki!

12
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:45,310
Do your best, Misaki!

13
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:47,380
Coach, are you sure?

14
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:50,920
He will transfer to another school after this match.

15
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:52,740
It's his last memory with everyone.

16
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:54,240
If he wants to play, let him play.

17
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,820
B-But...

18
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:59,320
Misaki is the one who cares most about the team.

19
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:01,920
If he can't play as he wants because of his injury...

20
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:04,230
...and realizes he's a burden to the team...

21
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:07,040
...he'll want to take himself out.

22
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:07,840
Come on!

23
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:10,920
No matter what, get it to Hyuga-san in front of the goal!

24
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:16,770
Misaki-san!

25
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:19,640
Taro...

26
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:23,580
Misaki-kun, your wound is worse than mine.

27
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:27,270
Yet you're enduring this pain and trying to get the ball to me.

28
00:01:27,270 --> 00:01:29,960
In response to this effort...

29
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:32,900
...I will definitely score!

