54
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:09,240
Episode 25:
Time for a Counter-Attack

55
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:09,240
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

56
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:09,750
To prevent him from crossing to Hyuga-kun...

57
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:12,330
...Misaki-kun is marking him.

58
00:03:14,330 --> 00:03:15,380
Misaki...

59
00:03:16,060 --> 00:03:18,420
Sawada-kun is the heart of the midfield.

60
00:03:18,420 --> 00:03:22,760
While he's being pressured this much, Meiwa can't establish order.

61
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:27,660
Misaki-san's injury is my fault.

62
00:03:27,660 --> 00:03:30,040
But there's nothing I can do.

63
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:32,230
I can't hold back!

64
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,270
Sawada-kun feints!

65
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,400
And a wall pass!

66
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,820
He gets past Misaki-kun!

67
00:03:39,820 --> 00:03:41,300
Oh no!

68
00:03:41,300 --> 00:03:42,780
Now I have to mark Kojiro!

69
00:03:43,780 --> 00:03:44,940
Exactly.

70
00:03:44,940 --> 00:03:49,150
My only goal is to pass to Hyuga-san.

71
00:03:49,150 --> 00:03:50,940
For Meiwa's victory...

72
00:03:50,940 --> 00:03:52,580
Hyuga-san, I'm counting on you!

73
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:54,750
Damn it!

74
00:03:54,750 --> 00:03:56,920
Nice pass, Takeshi!

75
00:03:57,820 --> 00:04:00,590
Misaki-kun intercepts the pass!

76
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:01,460
What?!

77
00:04:01,460 --> 00:04:03,630
But the ball ricochets off Hyuga-kun.

78
00:04:03,630 --> 00:04:05,180
It's not over yet.

79
00:04:05,180 --> 00:04:06,090
Let's clear it!

80
00:04:06,740 --> 00:04:08,160
Damn it!

81
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:10,060
Hyuga-kun goes for a header!

82
00:04:11,580 --> 00:04:15,000
But Wakabayashi-kun punches it away!

83
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,660
Not a single player is giving up!

84
00:04:18,900 --> 00:04:19,730
That's it!

85
00:04:23,940 --> 00:04:25,410
Tsubasa-kun!

86
00:04:25,410 --> 00:04:29,240
Misaki-kun clears the ball with his injured right leg!

87
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:34,540
A wonderful pass for Tsubasa-kun.

88
00:04:34,540 --> 00:04:35,700
Misaki-kun!

89
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:37,810
No one is marking him.

90
00:04:37,810 --> 00:04:40,540
And since he's in his own half, there's no offside.

91
00:04:40,540 --> 00:04:44,050
So that's it! Was this what Tsubasa-kun was after?!

92
00:04:44,050 --> 00:04:47,300
Nankatsu's time to counter-attack!

93
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:48,640
O-Oh no!

94
00:04:48,640 --> 00:04:49,300
Tsubasa...

95
00:04:50,270 --> 00:04:52,060
I'm counting on you, Tsubasa-kun.

96
00:04:52,060 --> 00:04:56,640
It's as if he was saving his strength for this moment.

97
00:04:56,640 --> 00:05:01,400
Tsubasa-kun is dribbling at full speed towards the Meiwa goal.

98
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:06,530
Meiwa, focused on attack, had their defense completely wide open!

99
00:05:06,530 --> 00:05:07,390
Damn it!

100
00:05:07,390 --> 00:05:10,530
If I had noticed earlier, I could have given instructions to everyone!

101
00:05:10,530 --> 00:05:12,540
Even if it's a one-on-one...

102
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:14,910
...no matter how close he gets, I'll stop him!

103
00:05:14,910 --> 00:05:16,920
Alright! Come on, do it!

104
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,790
Tsubasa-kun, we believe in you!

105
00:05:20,210 --> 00:05:21,840
My leg...

106
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:26,840
Wakabayashi-kun and Misaki-kun also played through this pain by gritting their teeth.

107
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:28,220
I can do it too!

108
00:05:28,220 --> 00:05:29,130
No way!

109
00:05:29,130 --> 00:05:31,350
It'll be terrible if he scores!

110
00:05:31,350 --> 00:05:33,140
I'm counting on you, Takeshi!

111
00:05:33,140 --> 00:05:35,140
The point that will decide the match.

112
00:05:35,140 --> 00:05:37,640
This confrontation will decide the match.

113
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:40,230
Tsubasa-kun shoots.

114
00:05:40,230 --> 00:05:41,730
I'll definitely stop it!

115
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,910
Sawada-kun stops him.

116
00:05:45,910 --> 00:05:48,400
He blocks Tsubasa-kun's shot with a sliding tackle.

117
00:05:50,530 --> 00:05:53,410
Tsubasa-kun fires a powerful mid-range shot!

118
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:57,080
Wakashimazu-kun parries it with his arm!

119
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:58,910
Amazing reflexes!

120
00:06:00,290 --> 00:06:03,960
But Tsubasa-kun still has a chance to shoot.

121
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:05,960
Will it be the equalizing goal?

122
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:12,930
Wakashimazu-kun clears the ball by spinning his body 180 degrees with a back kick used in karate!

123
00:06:14,430 --> 00:06:20,690
Even with star player Tsubasa-kun's shot as a result of this counter-attack plan, Nankatsu can't find the goal!

124
00:06:20,690 --> 00:06:22,690
Well done, Wakashimazu!

125
00:06:22,690 --> 00:06:24,190
Tsubasa...

126
00:06:24,190 --> 00:06:26,560
So close...

127
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,570
Tsubasa-kun...

128
00:06:29,130 --> 00:06:31,070
No, not yet!

129
00:06:31,070 --> 00:06:33,430
Tsubasa is still in front of the goal!

130
00:06:33,430 --> 00:06:35,950
We have to pass to Tsubasa once more!

131
00:06:35,950 --> 00:06:38,660
Don't let Nankatsu get this ball!

132
00:06:38,660 --> 00:06:41,420
Another battle will take place in midfield!

133
00:06:41,420 --> 00:06:44,170
Leave the aerial ball to me!

134
00:06:45,390 --> 00:06:48,170
Izawa-kun wins the aerial duel!

135
00:06:49,260 --> 00:06:50,050
Alright.

136
00:06:50,050 --> 00:06:51,440
We won't let you pass.

137
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:54,510
Meiwa's sliding squad, attack!

138
00:06:54,510 --> 00:06:57,260
Take this!

139
00:06:59,810 --> 00:07:00,890
Take it!

140
00:07:00,890 --> 00:07:02,060
Don't let them!

141
00:07:02,060 --> 00:07:04,070
A huge struggle!

142
00:07:04,070 --> 00:07:06,210
Will the ball go to Hyuga-kun?

143
00:07:06,210 --> 00:07:08,070
Or will it go to Tsubasa-kun?

144
00:07:08,070 --> 00:07:09,850
Do your best, Nankatsu!

145
00:07:09,850 --> 00:07:11,320
Pass to Tsubasa!

146
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:12,830
Hold on, Meiwa!

147
00:07:12,830 --> 00:07:13,950
We're counting on you!

148
00:07:14,610 --> 00:07:16,280
The final moments of the match!

149
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:18,950
Only 5 minutes left.

150
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:21,350
The ball went up!

151
00:07:21,350 --> 00:07:23,000
Which side will get it?

152
00:07:24,650 --> 00:07:25,500
Hyuga-san!

153
00:07:25,500 --> 00:07:27,210
Meiwa is a moment faster!

154
00:07:27,210 --> 00:07:28,130
Oh no!

155
00:07:28,130 --> 00:07:30,510
The ball goes directly forward.

156
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:31,170
Everyone!

157
00:07:31,690 --> 00:07:34,180
Hyuga-kun received the pass!

158
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:37,180
Only Misaki-kun and Wakabayashi-kun are in front of him.

159
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:38,720
Kojiro...

160
00:07:39,390 --> 00:07:40,950
Misaki!

161
00:07:40,950 --> 00:07:43,270
Hey, look at that!

162
00:07:40,950 --> 00:07:43,270
# Meiwa Elementary #

163
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:47,020
Look at the dribbling of Misaki, who transferred yesterday.

164
00:07:51,570 --> 00:07:54,250
Wow, you're playing very technically.

165
00:07:54,250 --> 00:07:55,720
Give up, give up.

166
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:58,410
Teach me some of those cool moves too.

167
00:07:58,410 --> 00:07:59,560
Okay.

168
00:08:00,870 --> 00:08:04,230
No need to learn such stupid tricks!

169
00:08:04,230 --> 00:08:05,370
Hyuga-san!

170
00:08:05,370 --> 00:08:08,600
What's the point of running around like that?

171
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,170
What?

172
00:08:09,170 --> 00:08:11,920
When you get the ball, you run straight!

173
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:14,090
You crush anyone in your path...

174
00:08:14,090 --> 00:08:16,510
...and head directly for the goal!

175
00:08:16,510 --> 00:08:18,970
Do you understand?!

176
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:29,520
Will Hyuga-kun be able to get past him with his brute force?

177
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:32,000
Or will Misaki-kun stop him with his technique?

178
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,660
I can't let you pass, Kojiro!

179
00:08:33,660 --> 00:08:36,070
Crush me if you can!

180
00:08:36,070 --> 00:08:37,660
Misaki!

181
00:08:37,660 --> 00:08:38,950
Brother!

182
00:08:43,300 --> 00:08:48,330
Hyuga-kun escapes from Misaki-kun by jumping to the side.

183
00:08:48,330 --> 00:08:48,830
What?!

184
00:08:48,830 --> 00:08:49,840
What?!

185
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:54,790
Hyuga-kun, who always runs straight at his opponent and crushes them...

186
00:08:54,790 --> 00:08:56,470
...feints for the first time!

187
00:08:57,510 --> 00:09:00,100
Hyuga-kun lost his balance!

188
00:09:00,100 --> 00:09:01,620
A one-on-one battle!

189
00:09:01,620 --> 00:09:03,350
I have to stop him right here!

190
00:09:03,350 --> 00:09:06,890
Hyuga-kun regains his balance and gets into shooting position!

191
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:11,730
Both players moved at the same time!

192
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,800
You did it, big brother!

193
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:37,320
Kojiro!

194
00:09:38,340 --> 00:09:40,850
You did it! You finally did it!

195
00:09:40,850 --> 00:09:44,100
Meiwa finally turns the situation around.

196
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:46,240
With 4 minutes left in the second half...

197
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:48,600
...this goal means so much!

198
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:51,810
Damn Hyuga!

199
00:09:51,810 --> 00:09:53,320
Hyuga-san!

200
00:09:55,680 --> 00:10:02,990
With the same pose he made before the tournament, Hyuga-kun announces his victory!

201
00:10:02,990 --> 00:10:05,870
I won this match!

202
00:10:08,970 --> 00:10:13,960
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

203
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:17,260
As the match nears its end...

204
00:10:17,260 --> 00:10:22,050
...Meiwa finally takes the lead over Nankatsu with Hyuga-kun's goal.

205
00:10:22,050 --> 00:10:24,050
Alright, we can do this.

206
00:10:24,050 --> 00:10:26,560
Thus, the victory flag will be ours.

207
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:29,360
This goal created a big gap.

208
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:32,060
Not just because the match is nearing its end.

209
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:37,860
While Nankatsu is structured around Tsubasa, Misaki, and Wakabayashi...

210
00:10:37,860 --> 00:10:41,610
...the remaining players fill the team's gaps.

211
00:10:41,780 --> 00:10:46,320
Meiwa, on the other hand, is structured around Hyuga, Sawada, and Wakashimazu...

212
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:49,040
...with the support of the remaining players.

213
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:55,580
In the final struggle, star player Tsubasa was stopped by Meiwa's Sawada and Wakashimazu.

214
00:10:55,580 --> 00:11:00,080
Moreover, there was no one who played a crucial role in the midfield battle...

215
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,470
...and Meiwa won.

216
00:11:01,550 --> 00:11:04,140
And now, at the Nankatsu goal...

217
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:07,890
...Hyuga broke through the wall formed by Misaki and Wakabayashi.

218
00:11:07,930 --> 00:11:15,690
In other words, this goal showed that Meiwa is stronger than Nankatsu.

219
00:11:15,690 --> 00:11:18,190
What are you going to do, Tsubasa?

220
00:11:19,030 --> 00:11:20,400
We did it, right?

221
00:11:19,340 --> 00:11:21,130
Nice shot, Hyuga-kun.

222
00:11:21,130 --> 00:11:21,900
What?

223
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:25,490
But the match isn't over yet.

224
00:11:27,620 --> 00:11:28,910
Tsubasa...

225
00:11:29,350 --> 00:11:32,210
Exactly. We can still fight.

226
00:11:32,210 --> 00:11:34,820
We haven't accepted defeat yet either!

227
00:11:34,820 --> 00:11:35,460
Yes.

228
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:40,340
We've won by overcoming many difficulties so far.

229
00:11:40,340 --> 00:11:42,470
We haven't lost yet, Meiwa!

230
00:11:42,470 --> 00:11:43,980
Everyone...

231
00:11:43,980 --> 00:11:47,300
Wakabayashi-san, spare gloves.

232
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:49,220
Thanks, Morisaki.

233
00:11:49,220 --> 00:11:51,430
Wakabayashi-san, how's your leg?

234
00:11:51,430 --> 00:11:54,230
Also, in that collision just now...

235
00:11:54,230 --> 00:11:55,240
What?

236
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,980
Not worth mentioning.

237
00:11:56,980 --> 00:11:59,980
You also did your best until you got here.

238
00:11:59,980 --> 00:12:03,660
In the last 4 minutes, I expect your cheers.

239
00:12:03,660 --> 00:12:04,860
Yes.

240
00:12:04,860 --> 00:12:08,240
As Tsubasa said. Now it's time to fight.

241
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:11,000
A real fight.

242
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:14,140
You have very good friends, Tsubasa.

243
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:18,920
Listen, everyone. Don't get complacent.

244
00:12:18,920 --> 00:12:21,760
Nankatsu is a very strong opponent when cornered.

245
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:22,720
Yes.

246
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:24,720
I won't hand you the match.

247
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:29,220
I even put aside my pride to achieve my goal!

248
00:12:29,220 --> 00:12:34,600
The goal just scored shows how much Hyuga-kun has developed in this match.

249
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:38,620
Hyuga-kun, who until now only played with brute force...

250
00:12:38,620 --> 00:12:41,160
...used technique for the first time.

251
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:43,160
That boy who plays with pure power...

252
00:12:43,160 --> 00:12:47,360
...put aside his stubbornness for the sake of his team's victory.

253
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:51,370
Tsubasa-kun, try to respond to this goal.

254
00:12:51,370 --> 00:12:54,400
Less than 4 minutes of the match remain.

255
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:57,630
Will Nankatsu be able to tie the game?

256
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:01,560
Let's go, Misaki-kun!

257
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:02,210
Yes!

258
00:13:02,210 --> 00:13:03,140
Mark them!

259
00:13:03,140 --> 00:13:05,840
Don't leave Tsubasa and Misaki unmarked!

260
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:06,680
Okay!

261
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:09,260
Meiwa goes to mark the duo as expected!

262
00:13:13,420 --> 00:13:17,500
With Tsubasa and Misaki currently injured, we have no choice but to do our best!

263
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:20,740
Nankatsu's final efforts!

264
00:13:20,740 --> 00:13:24,530
With determined team play, they carry the ball to the Meiwa goal.

265
00:13:24,530 --> 00:13:26,820
Alright, come on, Nankatsu!

266
00:13:26,820 --> 00:13:28,960
Put in your last strength!

267
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:31,330
Definitely score and equalize!

268
00:13:31,330 --> 00:13:36,910
Under loud cheers, will Nankatsu find a chance to shoot?

269
00:13:41,090 --> 00:13:44,640
Normally, I would shoot from here as I would to get past my opponent.

270
00:13:44,640 --> 00:13:46,700
But goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun.

271
00:13:46,700 --> 00:13:48,180
I can't shoot yet.

272
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:51,260
Tsubasa-kun sends it to the right.

273
00:13:51,260 --> 00:13:53,110
Izawa-kun is at that spot.

274
00:13:53,110 --> 00:13:55,220
Will a surprise long shot come?

275
00:13:55,220 --> 00:13:56,980
If you're coming, come on!

276
00:13:56,980 --> 00:14:01,050
No. If I shoot from this spot, it won't be effective.

277
00:14:02,310 --> 00:14:03,020
Taki!

278
00:14:05,030 --> 00:14:06,390
Should I shoot?

279
00:14:06,390 --> 00:14:07,950
No, I should cross!

280
00:14:07,950 --> 00:14:10,270
But if I send it towards the goal...

281
00:14:10,270 --> 00:14:13,120
...Wakashimazu can rise and cut it off.

282
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:14,120
Damn it!

283
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:16,300
I have no choice but to make a back pass.

284
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,060
No way.

285
00:14:18,060 --> 00:14:21,320
We're just running out the remaining time like this.

286
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:24,590
Only 3 minutes left! There's not much time!

287
00:14:24,590 --> 00:14:25,460
Damn it!

288
00:14:25,460 --> 00:14:29,800
We're in front of the goal, but how will we succeed if we can't shoot?!

289
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:30,510
Let's take it!

290
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:32,670
Meiwa's stubborn defense!

291
00:14:32,670 --> 00:14:34,180
What will Misaki-kun do?

292
00:14:34,180 --> 00:14:36,510
It's true that Meiwa's defense is stubborn.

293
00:14:36,510 --> 00:14:39,710
But we can't score if we can't shoot.

294
00:14:39,710 --> 00:14:43,230
And right now, the only one who can take that shot is Tsubasa-kun!

295
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:47,820
Shoot! No one else but you can shoot!

296
00:14:47,820 --> 00:14:49,220
Exactly, Tsubasa!

297
00:14:49,220 --> 00:14:53,570
Right now, we can't trust anyone else but you to shoot, Tsubasa!

298
00:14:53,570 --> 00:14:55,950
Misaki-kun, everyone...

299
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:59,040
Alright, let's go!

300
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:02,000
Tsubasa-kun jumps!

301
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:03,080
This...

302
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,130
I'll catch it!

303
00:15:04,130 --> 00:15:07,270
There! Tsubasa's favorite move!

304
00:15:07,270 --> 00:15:10,880
Will the overhead kick result in a goal?!

305
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:14,600
Go!

306
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:15,500
Tsubasa!

307
00:15:15,500 --> 00:15:16,430
Wakashimazu!

308
00:15:17,180 --> 00:15:18,060
I'll catch it!

309
00:15:19,100 --> 00:15:20,820
H-He caught it!

310
00:15:20,820 --> 00:15:23,310
Nankatsu can't equalize!

311
00:15:23,310 --> 00:15:24,900
You did it, Wakashimazu!

312
00:15:26,820 --> 00:15:27,570
Alright!

313
00:15:27,570 --> 00:15:28,650
I won't allow it!

314
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:32,320
Wakashimazu quickly clears the ball!

315
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:35,280
And the ball...

316
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:37,280
We did it! We're the champions!

317
00:15:37,280 --> 00:15:39,540
Only 1 minute left in the match.

318
00:15:39,540 --> 00:15:41,790
If Hyuga-kun holds this ball...

319
00:15:41,790 --> 00:15:44,380
...the winner of the match will be determined!

320
00:15:44,380 --> 00:15:45,790
Alright!

321
00:15:47,170 --> 00:15:48,000
What?!

322
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,900
W-Wakabayashi!

323
00:15:49,900 --> 00:15:54,720
Th-This... Nankatsu goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun steals the ball with a risky charge!

324
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:56,140
Wakabayashi-san!

325
00:15:56,140 --> 00:15:57,760
Stubborn bastards!

326
00:15:57,760 --> 00:16:02,350
Wakabayashi-kun dribbles the ball into Meiwa's half.

327
00:16:02,350 --> 00:16:04,560
Less than a minute left.

328
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:08,130
Nankatsu still seems to have a chance!

329
00:16:08,130 --> 00:16:09,110
Genzo...

330
00:16:09,110 --> 00:16:12,370
Even goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun is taking part in the attack.

331
00:16:12,370 --> 00:16:16,620
Their final attack will be with a full 11 players.

332
00:16:16,620 --> 00:16:19,370
I allowed Hyuga to score 2 goals.

333
00:16:19,370 --> 00:16:24,620
At the very least... At the very least, I'll clean up my own mess at the last moment!

334
00:16:24,620 --> 00:16:29,210
Wakabayashi-kun stops dribbling and gets into shooting position!

335
00:16:29,210 --> 00:16:30,460
Come on!

336
00:16:31,630 --> 00:16:33,530
Meiwa's defense can't react!

337
00:16:33,530 --> 00:16:37,850
Wakabayashi-kun fires a fate-deciding long shot with all his might!

338
00:16:37,850 --> 00:16:40,370
Long shots don't work on me!

339
00:16:40,370 --> 00:16:41,470
I'll catch it!

340
00:16:41,470 --> 00:16:42,470
Misaki!

341
00:16:42,470 --> 00:16:43,060
Okay!

342
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:47,890
Misaki-kun jumps with his injured leg!

343
00:16:47,890 --> 00:16:49,690
He changed its direction!

344
00:16:49,690 --> 00:16:50,570
Oh no!

345
00:16:50,570 --> 00:16:51,260
He did it!

346
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:52,190
Misaki!

347
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:55,650
The ball is going out!

348
00:16:55,650 --> 00:16:56,450
That's it!

349
00:16:56,450 --> 00:16:57,660
He missed!

350
00:16:57,660 --> 00:16:59,120
Won't it happen?!

351
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:02,450
Tsubasa-kun leaps forward quickly!

352
00:17:02,450 --> 00:17:04,080
But it seems he won't make it!

353
00:17:04,080 --> 00:17:06,120
The ball is too far!

354
00:17:06,120 --> 00:17:10,630
My overhead kick, which everyone trusted, went to waste.

355
00:17:10,630 --> 00:17:16,970
But this time, for the sake of Wakabayashi-kun and Misaki-kun...

356
00:17:17,700 --> 00:17:22,060
...I will turn this into a goal by shooting no matter what!

357
00:17:22,060 --> 00:17:25,350
Tsubasa-kun does a handspring on the ground using his left hand!

358
00:17:26,340 --> 00:17:29,230
And by doing so, he propels himself forward and reaches the ball!

359
00:17:30,230 --> 00:17:31,730
Go!

360
00:17:31,730 --> 00:17:34,400
He shot!

361
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:36,400
G-Goal!

362
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:38,410
E-Equalizer!

363
00:17:38,410 --> 00:17:42,280
Tsubasa-kun's handspring becomes a goal just before the match ends...

364
00:17:42,280 --> 00:17:47,080
...and Nankatsu ties it 2-2!

365
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:48,960
H-He did it!

366
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,380
You did it, Tsubasa!

367
00:17:50,380 --> 00:17:51,590
We caught up to them!

368
00:17:51,590 --> 00:17:52,980
Equalizer...

369
00:17:52,980 --> 00:17:56,970
Just one step... We were just one step away from victory.

370
00:17:58,540 --> 00:18:02,220
If I could have noticed Misaki's jump earlier...

371
00:18:02,220 --> 00:18:03,960
They did it, Anego!

372
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:04,490
Yes.

373
00:18:04,490 --> 00:18:06,850
We did it, we did it! Equalizer!

374
00:18:06,850 --> 00:18:09,730
It was a miraculous goal!

375
00:18:09,730 --> 00:18:13,400
Three star players scored it together!

376
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:17,900
Even though all three had injured legs, they did their best.

377
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:26,660
Damn it! If I could have noticed Wakabayashi coming out and prevented him from stealing the ball...

378
00:18:26,660 --> 00:18:29,860
...they wouldn't have been able to take that shot!

379
00:18:31,140 --> 00:18:34,800
And the whistle blows to end the second half!

380
00:18:35,460 --> 00:18:40,290
After a total of 40 minutes of struggle in the first and second halves, no conclusion was reached.

381
00:18:40,290 --> 00:18:44,350
But there will be no penalty shootouts in the finals...

382
00:18:44,350 --> 00:18:50,310
...and after a 10-minute break, two 5-minute extra time periods will be played.

383
00:18:50,310 --> 00:18:53,540
If no conclusion is reached again...

384
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:56,030
...two more 5-minute extra time periods will be played.

385
00:18:56,030 --> 00:19:01,780
If both teams are still tied after extra time, both will be declared champions.

386
00:19:01,780 --> 00:19:03,750
You let your guard down at the last moment.

387
00:19:03,750 --> 00:19:05,030
Y-Yes.

388
00:19:05,030 --> 00:19:08,060
But what's done is done.

389
00:19:08,060 --> 00:19:09,210
Don't dwell on it.

390
00:19:09,210 --> 00:19:11,180
Now we have to focus on extra time!

391
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:14,890
Our opponent's three star players are injured.

392
00:19:14,890 --> 00:19:17,460
We are the advantageous side.

393
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:18,740
Listen!

394
00:19:18,740 --> 00:19:20,020
Now determination will speak!

395
00:19:20,020 --> 00:19:23,000
If you don't break in terms of determination, victory is yours!

396
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:23,970
Yes!

397
00:19:24,550 --> 00:19:26,970
Misaki, can you show me your wound?

398
00:19:28,220 --> 00:19:32,270
It will be very difficult without you, but you shouldn't play in extra time.

399
00:19:32,270 --> 00:19:34,730
Taro, how are you?

400
00:19:34,730 --> 00:19:36,700
Dad...

401
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:38,460
Can you continue or not?

402
00:19:38,460 --> 00:19:41,360
You know best.

403
00:19:41,360 --> 00:19:43,740
I'm fine. I can continue.

404
00:19:43,740 --> 00:19:49,030
Didn't you finish all the paintings you started, Dad?

405
00:19:49,030 --> 00:19:53,750
I too will go out on the field and play the match I started until the very end.

406
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:55,750
Taro...

407
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:58,750
Let me handle it.

408
00:19:59,380 --> 00:20:00,980
Mikami-san!

409
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:05,510
We need to wrap it with a bandage.

410
00:20:05,510 --> 00:20:08,700
Genzo, I know how you feel.

411
00:20:08,700 --> 00:20:10,470
Do your best in extra time.

412
00:20:10,470 --> 00:20:12,230
Okay.

413
00:20:13,050 --> 00:20:18,070
My coach used to massage me like this when I was playing.

414
00:20:18,070 --> 00:20:21,290
Tsubasa, your last shot was very good.

415
00:20:21,290 --> 00:20:24,480
You always amaze me with your play.

416
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:25,490
Yes.

417
00:20:25,490 --> 00:20:29,320
Among the three of you, your injury is the lightest.

418
00:20:29,320 --> 00:20:32,160
We have no choice but to do our best in extra time.

419
00:20:32,160 --> 00:20:34,160
I know, Roberto.

420
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:36,310
Nankatsu will definitely win.

421
00:20:36,310 --> 00:20:37,710
Then we'll go to Brazil!

422
00:20:39,210 --> 00:20:41,380
Yes, I know.

423
00:20:41,380 --> 00:20:43,870
But for now, you have to focus on this match.

424
00:20:43,870 --> 00:20:46,050
Just think about winning the match.

425
00:20:46,050 --> 00:20:47,800
Yes.

