00:20:47,800 --> 00:20:51,060
The temperature is currently 35 degrees.

427
00:20:51,060 --> 00:20:55,270
The players are putting up a great fight in this sweltering heat.

428
00:20:55,270 --> 00:20:59,770
The extra time of the Nankatsu-Meiwa match is about to begin.

429
00:21:00,470 --> 00:21:01,940
Tsubasa...

430
00:21:01,940 --> 00:21:03,350
Kojiro...

431
00:21:03,350 --> 00:21:05,070
Do your best, big brother!

432
00:21:05,620 --> 00:21:08,870
This time, I'll score and finish it!

433
00:21:09,660 --> 00:21:11,370
We won't lose, Meiwa.

434
00:21:11,370 --> 00:21:13,620
We will win!

